          "inspiration": "A simple model for the evolution of molecular codes driven by the interplay of accuracy, diversity and cost",
          "concept": "molecular codes as noisy channels constrained by accuracy, diversity, and cost",
          "adaptation": "Homochirality is treated as a coding constraint that reduces cross-handed noise in electron-transfer and recognition channels; the assay computes fidelity, mutual information, and cost for different enantiomeric compositions.",
